      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这两个命题，我们不加证明而承认它们的正确性，并且简",
        "单地叙述成："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**7 三点属于一条直线当且仅当其中的一点在另外两点",
        "之间．**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用命题7来证明下面的定理．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**8 定理（三角形不等式）．如果$A$、$B$和$C$不属于一条直",
        "线，那么距离$|AC|$小于距离$|AB|$与$|BC|$的和．**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明．设点$A$、$B$和$C$不在一条直线上（参看图11，б）．",
        "由距离的第三条性质得"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$|AC|\\leqslant|AB|+|BC|$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "也就是说，要么$|AC|<|AB|+|BC|$，要么$|AC|=|AB|+↵|BC|$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "但是等式$|AC|=|AB|+|BC|$不可能成立．因为这个等",
        "式成立意味着点$B$在$A$和$C$两点之间．于是（由命题7）点$A$、",
        "$B$和$C$就应当属于同一条直线．这和已知条件矛盾．因此，",
        "$|AC|<|AB|+|BC|$．$\\blacksquare$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题和习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "39",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "39.° 点$X$在点$A$和$B$之间．说点$X$在点$B$和$A$之间对吗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "40",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "40.° 如果点$X$不在点$A$和$B$之间，那么这三点不在一条直线",
        "上．这种说法对不对？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "41",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "41.° 对“在……之间”这个概念下定义时用到了哪些几何",
        "概念？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
